luci-app-socat-reforged
Copyright (C) 2026 busybin

This package is an independent, from-scratch reimplementation ("reforged")
of a socat port-forward manager for the modern (ucode/JavaScript) LuCI, which
is required from OpenWrt 24.10 onward and is the only option from 25.10 (the
classic Lua/CBI userspace and luci-compat are gone there).

No source code was copied from the projects below; only the general idea of a
socat forwarding UI and the configuration field names (a functional interface)
are shared. They are credited here in the spirit of the original work.

Prior art / inspiration
-----------------------
* luci-app-socat (original) - Lienol
    https://github.com/Lienol/openwrt-package
* luci-app-socat - chenmozhijin (GPL-3.0)
    https://github.com/chenmozhijin/luci-app-socat
    Its configuration schema and the "open firewall port" convenience informed
    our design.
* luci-app-socatg - big-tooth (MIT)
    https://github.com/big-tooth/luci-app-socatg

Runtime dependency (installed by your distribution, not bundled here)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
* socat - https://www.dest-unreach.org/socat/ (GPL-2.0)
  Provides the actual relay; this package only generates and supervises the
  socat command lines and keeps a dedicated WAN-accept firewall rule in sync.
